# システム環境設定's サウンド page (design 11, 6.5), for tools/ui_run.py with --wav (a USB
# sound device beside the machine's): the outputs listed, one chosen at once and kept in the
# machine's settings, 〈試聴〉 heard on it, the volume of a USB function, and the choice as
# kept when the window is opened again. The window is at 160,80: in 機器情報, サウンド at
# 228,286 and 表示 at 706,184; on the page, 自動 at 480,161, the USB function at 480,178,
# the volume at 470,420 and 試聴 at 410,458. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 228 286
wait 200
click 706 184
expect sysenv: sound 2 outputs, chosen auto, playing none
wait 300
shot snd_page
# the USB function chosen: taken at once, kept
click 480 178
expect sysenv: sound output usb:46f4:0002@
expect sysenv: sound 2 outputs, chosen usb:46f4:0002@
# a tone on it
click 410 458
expect sysenv: sound test 0
expect usb: audio plays at 48000 Hz
wait 150
shot snd_playing
# the volume of the function
click 470 420
expect sysenv: sound volume
shot snd_volume
wait 800
# opened again: the USB function still chosen
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
# (the console's lines of this second opening are the same as some of the first's, so
# it is waited for long enough to be up -- it takes some seconds -- and the shots tell)
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
wait 8000
win システム環境設定
click 228 286
wait 300
click 706 184
wait 1200
shot snd_again
# back to 自動
click 480 161
expect sysenv: sound output auto
wait 500
shot snd_auto
# 出力を止めずに流し続ける (498,493): on, the stream starts with nothing to play and goes on;
# off, it stops again (the USB function's while after a sound is none)
click 498 493
expect sysenv: sound keep 1 (0)
expect snd: the stream kept going
wait 1500
shot snd_keep
click 498 493
expect sysenv: sound keep 0 (0)
expect snd: the stream stops when nothing plays
wait 500
key 08 01
wait 500
absent !OACV!
